extends emailBase

block content
    p Hi #{firstName},
    p A request was made to change your email address on Natours to #{old}. This may be an attempt by a hacker to hijack your account!
    p  If this wasn't you please follow this link below urgently to block this attempt and secure your account, otherwise you're safe to ignore this warning. This is a security measure to avoid your account being compromised by someone with bad intentions.
    table.btn.btn-primary(role='presentation', border='0', cellpadding='0', cellspacing='0')
        tbody
            tr
                td(align='left')
                    table(role='presentation', border='0', cellpadding='0', cellspacing='0')
                        tbody
                            tr
                                td
                                    a(href=`${url}`, target='_blank') Block Email Change
    p Please keep your login details private, we're here to keep you safe.